                     Evidence protected\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"steps\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2\">\n                <button class=\"step active\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1\" data-step=\"1\">\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1\">\n                        01 · Person details\n                    </strong>\n                    Reference identity and appearance\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2\" data-step=\"2\">\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1\">\n                        02 · Last known information\n                    </strong>\n                    Location, time, routes\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-3\" data-step=\"3\">\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-3-1\">\n                        03 · Search configuration\n                    </strong>\n                    Coverage and threshold\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-4\" data-step=\"4\">\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-4-1\">\n                        04 · Review case\n                    </strong>\n                    Confirm and begin search\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"create-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3\">\n                <div class=\"panel form-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1\">\n                    <div class=\"form-step active\" data-form-step=\"1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-1\">\n                            Person details\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-2\">\n                            Upload a clear reference image and capture the visual details investigators will use during review.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"form-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3\">\n                            <label class=\"dropzone\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1\" style=\"grid-row:span 3\">\n                                <input data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1-1\" hidden=\"\" type=\"file\"/>\n                                <i class=\"ico\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1-2\" data-lucide=\"cloud-upload\">\n                                </i>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1-3\">\n                                    Upload clear face photograph\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1-4\">\n                                    Front-facing photo preferred · JPG or PNG\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-1-5\" style=\"color:#5e8590;margin-top:15px\">\n                                    Drag and drop or browse files\n                                </span>\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-2\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-2-1\">\n                                    Full name\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-2-2\" value=\"Rahul Sharma\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-3\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-3-1\">\n                                    Age\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-3-2\" value=\"17\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-4\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-1-3-4-1\">\n                          