lack hair, brown eyes.</textarea>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-step\" data-form-step=\"2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-1\">\n                            Last known information\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-2\">\n                            Anchor the investigation to the last known moment and provide context for the search perimeter.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"form-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3\">\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-1\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                    Last seen location\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-1-2\" value=\"Central Bus Station\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-2\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                                    Date\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-2-2\" type=\"date\" value=\"2026-09-10\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-3\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-3-1\">\n                                    Time\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-3-2\" type=\"time\" value=\"09:50\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-4\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-4-1\">\n                                    Known routes\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-4-2\" value=\"North Entrance → Main Gate\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group wide\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-5\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-5-1\">\n                                    Description\n                                </label>\n                                <textarea class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-5-2\">Last seen leaving the central terminal toward the north entrance. May have been accompanied by a small backpack.</textarea>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group wide\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-6\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-6-1\">\n                                    Additional information\n                                </label>\n                                <textarea class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-3-6-2\" placeholder=\"Relevant context for authorized investigators...\"></textarea>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mini-map\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-4\">\n                            <span class=\"map-label ml1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-4-1\">\n                                North Entrance\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"map-label ml2\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-2-4-2\">\n                                Main Gate\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-step\" data-form-step=\"3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-1\">\n                            Search configuration\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-2\">\n                            Define the footage window and camera coverage. Similarity is a review signal, not identity confirmation.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"form-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3\">\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-1\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-1-1\">\n                                    Search date range\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-1-2\" value=\"10 Sep 2026 — 10 Sep 2026\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-2\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-2-1\">\n                                    Search time range\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-2-2\" value=\"09:30 — 15:00\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-3\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-3-1\">\n                                    Camera zones\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-3-2\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-3-2-1\">\n                                        Transit campus · 4 zones\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-4\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-4-1\">\n                                    Camera groups\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"form-control\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-4-2\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-4-2-1\">\n                                        All accessible groups\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group wide\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-5\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-5-1\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px\">\n                                    <input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-5-1-1\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                                    Search all available cameras\n                                </label>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-5-2\" style=\"color:#718791;font-size:10px\">\n                                    128 cameras available · 4 cameras currently offline\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group wide\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-6\">\n                                <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-6-1\">\n                                    Minimum AI confidence · 75%\n                                </label>\n                                <input data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-3-3-6-2\" max=\"95\" min=\"50\" style=\"width:100%;accent-color:var(--cyan)\" type=\"range\" value=\"75\"/>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-step\" data-form-step=\"4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-1\">\n                            Review and create\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-2\">\n                            Confirm the case details and search scope before creating the investigation record.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"form-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3\">\n                            <div class=\"detail-block\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-1\">\n                                    Person\n                                </h3>\n                                <div class=\"detail-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-1\">\n                                        <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                                            Name\n                                        </label>\n                                        <b data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                                            Rahul Sharma · 17\n                                        </b>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-2\">\n                                        <label data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                                            Reference photo\n                                        </label>\n                                        <b data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                                            Selected · front-facing\n                                        </b>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"detail-block\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-2\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-2-1\">\n                                    Last known moment\n                                </h3>\n                                <div class=\"detail-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-2-2\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-3-1-4-3-2-2-1\"